## 👨‍💻 About Me

I'm **Alazar Sisay**, a Computer Science graduate and Full-Stack Web Developer from Ethiopia.

I build modern, responsive web applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, Express.js and PostgreSQL.

My focus is on clean code, practical solutions, database-driven applications and reliable software development.

**Currently open to Junior Full-Stack Developer opportunities.**

